    },
    {
      "id": "u_f3896c44f9fa9ef125056798_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium uses Electron which is based on Chromium (the open-source alternative to Google Chrome); in order to improve performance it makes use of __TRILIUM_PH_0__GPU acceleration__TRILIUM_PH_1__. In some cases, a GPU incompatibility (especially on older models of integrated graphics) can cause nothing to render at all, resulting in a blank window. ",
      "sourceHash": "f3896c44f9fa9ef1250567987cdc2b47055e4e66f4c2a1aa13fddd3dce00345e",
      "context": "Troubleshooting > Trilium only shows a blank window",
      "contextHash": "3b86f782c40d4b3c059c5c8c077b62d535d12ba25fbf973f00d4f6c43dd6dbb5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Triliumは、Google Chromeのオープンソース版であるChromiumをベースにしたElectronを使用しています。パフォーマンスを向上させるために__TRILIUM_PH_0__GPUアクセラレーション__TRILIUM_PH_1__を利用しますが、GPUの非互換性（特に古いモデルの内蔵グラフィックス）により何も描画されず、真っ白なウィンドウになってしまう場合があります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ae70601272993e27112a3979_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To bypass this, try running Trilium with the following command line argument:",
      "sourceHash": "ae70601272993e27112a39795ca03c9bd2c443a9e13579e35cf28e469ed59dbe",
      "context": "Troubleshooting > Trilium only shows a blank window",
      "contextHash": "3b86f782c40d4b3c059c5c8c077b62d535d12ba25fbf973f00d4f6c43dd6dbb5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "これを回避するには、次のコマンドライン引数をつけてTriliumを実行してみてください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d9361993dd14e3bf5b4667ed_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If that doesn't work, try the following commands as well:",
      "sourceHash": "d9361993dd14e3bf5b4667ed79b9d3c2c0273b72de65c06ee318b17e080f8c2f",
      "context": "Troubleshooting > Trilium only shows a blank window",
      "contextHash": "3b86f782c40d4b3c059c5c8c077b62d535d12ba25fbf973f00d4f6c43dd6dbb5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "それでも解決しない場合は、次のコマンドもお試しください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
