    {
      "id": "u_14a2264020154077988b6edd_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ (this one forces the rendering to X11 on Wayland)",
      "sourceHash": "14a2264020154077988b6eddae16431a48b3bbaf7c72bb77c56f548f893c89cb",
      "context": "Troubleshooting > Trilium only shows a blank window",
      "contextHash": "3b86f782c40d4b3c059c5c8c077b62d535d12ba25fbf973f00d4f6c43dd6dbb5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ （Wayland環境でX11での描画を強制します）",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_90f0afd1cdecbe7f71f495c9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If Trilium renders fine after this, Trilium offers a built-in option to disable GPU acceleration: go to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Appearance__TRILIUM_PH_3__, look for the __TRILIUM_PH_4__Performance__TRILIUM_PH_5__ section and then uncheck __TRILIUM_PH_6__Hardware acceleration (GPU)__TRILIUM_PH_7__.",
      "sourceHash": "90f0afd1cdecbe7f71f495c920ecf63802ff8f0831bb370a96184fa2a961c1eb",
      "context": "Troubleshooting > Trilium only shows a blank window",
      "contextHash": "3b86f782c40d4b3c059c5c8c077b62d535d12ba25fbf973f00d4f6c43dd6dbb5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "この操作のあとでTriliumが正常に描画される場合、TriliumにはGPUアクセラレーションを無効にする組み込みオプションが用意されています。__TRILIUM_PH_0__オプション__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__外観__TRILIUM_PH_3__に移動し、__TRILIUM_PH_4__パフォーマンス__TRILIUM_PH_5__セクションを探して、__TRILIUM_PH_6__ハードウェアアクセラレーション (GPU)__TRILIUM_PH_7__のチェックを外してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    }
